WEBVTT

00:12:29.678 --> 00:12:32.743
come together and co-create
frugal solutions

00:12:32.743 --> 00:12:35.135
that benefit the entire humanity.

00:12:35.135 --> 00:12:37.923
The exciting news is
that's starting to happen.

00:12:37.923 --> 00:12:40.547
Let's go to Nairobi to find that out.

00:12:40.547 --> 00:12:44.167
Nairobi has horrendous traffic jams.

00:12:44.167 --> 00:12:47.082
When I first saw them,
I thought, "Holy cow."

00:12:47.082 --> 00:12:52.258
Literally, because you have to dodge cows
as well when you drive in Nairobi.

00:12:52.258 --> 00:12:54.186
To ease the situation,

00:12:54.186 --> 00:13:00.707
the engineers at the IBM lab in Kenya
are piloting a solution called Megaffic,